WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.300 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 27]

01:52.920 --> 01:53.410
Elder Tang,

01:54.150 --> 01:55.740
I'll give you three moves to think it over.

01:56.400 --> 01:57.180
Within three moves,

01:58.280 --> 01:59.130
Blood River is still willing

01:59.200 --> 02:00.330
to befriend the Tang Clan.

02:01.350 --> 02:02.330
After three moves,

02:03.870 --> 02:05.460
we settle it by life and death.

02:35.150 --> 02:36.100
Su Muyu's here...

02:52.630 --> 02:53.450
He's here!

03:09.080 --> 03:09.610
You folks from the Tang Clan

03:09.680 --> 03:10.410
are really something.

03:11.560 --> 03:12.980
You shout before you strike.

03:13.630 --> 03:15.260
Even your hidden weapons are used so openly.

03:17.960 --> 03:19.010
Shout or not,

03:19.750 --> 03:21.850
I'm just as confident I'll beat you.

03:34.240 --> 03:34.940
Su Muyu,

03:35.240 --> 03:36.170
you finally showed up!

03:36.560 --> 03:36.980
Xuewei...

03:37.190 --> 03:38.260
Xuewei was taken by them!

03:39.710 --> 03:40.820
Why did they take her?

03:41.870 --> 03:42.380
Seems

03:42.680 --> 03:44.060
they want the poison in her.

03:48.560 --> 03:49.260
We'll talk after we're back.

03:53.710 --> 03:54.380
You're not leaving!

03:54.430 --> 03:55.380
For our companion in your hands,

03:55.870 --> 03:57.060
you'd better keep her

03:57.360 --> 03:58.060
safe and sound!

04:01.080 --> 04:02.410
I hate to admit it,

04:03.280 --> 04:04.940
but it's the truth:

04:06.190 --> 04:08.010
we simply can't stop

04:08.960 --> 04:09.980
this Su family head

04:10.680 --> 04:11.380
from doing whatever he wants

04:11.470 --> 04:13.010
right in front of us.

04:13.820 --> 04:16.500
[Refined Brew, Serene Mind]

04:32.870 --> 04:33.370
Are you dead?

04:36.560 --> 04:37.220
You jinx.

04:39.000 --> 04:39.900
I'm just exhausted.

04:40.510 --> 04:41.780
I'm the head of a house.

04:42.390 --> 04:43.250
I don't die that easily.

04:44.270 --> 04:44.660
Qingyang,

04:44.870 --> 04:45.850
what happened?

04:46.070 --> 04:46.660
Where's Xuewei?

04:47.120 --> 04:48.170
Why didn't she come back with you?

04:49.430 --> 04:50.020
Xuewei...

04:50.560 --> 04:51.580
Xuewei was taken.

04:52.070 --> 04:52.730
The one who took her

04:53.160 --> 04:54.490
is the one Mr. Su mentioned,

04:55.000 --> 04:56.340
the physician who refines drugged puppets.

04:57.480 --> 04:58.490
Ghost Physician Night Crow.

04:59.630 --> 05:01.050
So she's in Jin City too.

05:02.390 --> 05:03.540
How interesting.

05:04.000 --> 05:04.780
Anyway,

05:05.240 --> 05:06.040
we need a plan

05:06.040 --> 05:07.050
to get Xuewei out first.

05:09.070 --> 05:10.340
Night Crow took Xuewei

05:10.950 --> 05:12.540
for the poison in her body.

05:13.360 --> 05:14.290
With her methods,

05:14.720 --> 05:16.220
Xuewei will be put through hell.

05:17.120 --> 05:18.290
And the two of them now

05:19.000 --> 05:20.610
are surely inside the Tang Clan.

05:23.750 --> 05:24.730
Looks like our betrothal

05:25.000 --> 05:25.850
has to be put on hold.

05:27.000 --> 05:28.930
We should check the Tang Clan first.

05:30.950 --> 05:32.100
Here in Jin City,

05:32.160 --> 05:33.460
you still let him get away?

05:36.750 --> 05:37.930
Blood River's arrival

05:39.430 --> 05:41.220
has shaken a board

05:41.240 --> 05:42.250
once settled.

05:43.560 --> 05:44.460
We have to hold them in check.

05:45.270 --> 05:46.900
Don't let them ruin our plan.

05:48.040 --> 05:48.660
But, Madam,

05:49.270 --> 05:50.730
Mu Xuewei is in Night Crow's hands.

05:51.480 --> 05:51.980
And Night Crow...

05:52.120 --> 05:53.370
This is the Tang Clan.

05:54.750 --> 05:56.370
Do we really have to take our cues from her?

05:57.510 --> 05:58.370
If she wants to do anything,

05:59.070 --> 06:00.100
she has three days to finish.

06:01.270 --> 06:01.980
After that,

06:02.000 --> 06:03.170
hand Mu Xuewei over intact.

06:05.510 --> 06:06.780
As you command, Madam.

06:12.310 --> 06:13.660
Please be very careful, Madam.

06:14.240 --> 06:15.980
I hear Blood River's Su Changhe

06:16.190 --> 06:17.850
is a nasty opponent.

06:22.720 --> 06:23.610
They say

06:24.160 --> 06:25.460
he's a schemer,

06:26.190 --> 06:27.410
putting profit first in all things.

06:28.310 --> 06:29.290
I'm not afraid of men like that.

06:30.430 --> 06:32.100
I only fear people who reason.

06:33.680 --> 06:34.490
After all,

06:35.920 --> 06:36.930
Su Changhe and I

06:36.950 --> 06:37.810
are the same kind of man.

06:38.680 --> 06:40.050
He's just luckier than me

06:40.480 --> 06:42.290
and took the top seat of Blood River.

06:43.510 --> 06:44.340
But soon,

06:45.310 --> 06:46.730
the Tang Sect's seat of power

06:47.720 --> 06:49.340
will be mine to claim.

06:52.140 --> 06:55.740
[Tang Lingzun of Tang Clan]

07:07.630 --> 07:09.170
Senior,

07:10.120 --> 07:11.100
this is the poisonous person

07:11.240 --> 07:12.900
our Master once mentioned.

07:14.160 --> 07:15.850
I searched the world

07:16.310 --> 07:17.850
and never met a single one.

07:18.750 --> 07:19.810
Who knows,

07:20.560 --> 07:22.080
here in Jin City,

07:22.080 --> 07:23.410
I'd run right into one.

07:24.430 --> 07:25.850
If I pair a poisonous person

07:26.480 --> 07:28.580
with my drugged puppet craft,

07:30.120 --> 07:32.100
what a terrifying thing that will make.

07:37.040 --> 07:38.050
Senior,

07:38.830 --> 07:40.050
in medicine,

07:40.310 --> 07:42.100
you're far above me.

07:43.160 --> 07:44.410
But in the dark arts,

07:45.430 --> 07:47.100
you're nowhere near me.

07:47.680 --> 07:48.660
Look, Senior.

07:49.870 --> 07:51.220
These two drugged puppets

07:51.750 --> 07:54.460
were Vajra Mortal-Stage masters in life.

07:55.720 --> 07:57.460
Refined into puppets,

07:58.000 --> 07:59.850
they don't die or feel pain.

08:01.390 --> 08:02.100
And now,

08:02.480 --> 08:04.490
with toxins from this "Poisonous Blossom",

08:05.310 --> 08:07.020
I'll reforge them

08:07.630 --> 08:09.660
into poison-laced drugged puppets.

08:11.000 --> 08:12.780
One hit from them

08:14.120 --> 08:15.540
and anyone

08:16.630 --> 08:19.020
won't last a stick of incense.

08:20.870 --> 08:21.340
You...

08:50.150 --> 08:50.890
Ms Night Crow.

08:53.200 --> 08:54.580
What brings you here all of a sudden?

08:56.240 --> 08:56.980
The Madam wants

08:58.150 --> 08:59.420
to invite Blood River to meet,

09:00.200 --> 09:00.850
and...

09:02.510 --> 09:03.700
offer a meeting gift.

09:04.480 --> 09:05.580
A meeting gift?

09:09.240 --> 09:10.850
Seems that gift

09:11.270 --> 09:12.820
has something to do with me.

09:15.440 --> 09:15.890
Yes.

09:17.120 --> 09:19.130
The gift is Mu Xuewei herself.

09:21.360 --> 09:22.130
Ms Night Crow,

09:23.750 --> 09:25.460
Blood River isn't easy

09:25.510 --> 09:26.580
to negotiate with.

09:27.510 --> 09:28.220
So...

09:29.030 --> 09:30.730
we ask for your understanding.

09:31.630 --> 09:32.370
Understanding?

09:33.550 --> 09:34.460
Without me,

09:34.670 --> 09:36.340
could you have subdued Tang Linghuang?

09:37.000 --> 09:38.770
And now you ask me to "understand"?

09:40.870 --> 09:42.610
Is Blood River so fearsome?

09:43.600 --> 09:44.610
Once,

09:44.840 --> 09:46.270
I nearly killed

09:46.270 --> 09:47.540
that Su family head.

09:48.750 --> 09:50.060
Per the Madam,

09:50.750 --> 09:53.060
she doesn't wish to clash with Blood River yet.

09:54.150 --> 09:54.980
So she wants

09:56.200 --> 09:57.490
Mu Xuewei handed over

09:58.550 --> 09:59.180
safe and sound

09:59.200 --> 10:00.650
three days from now.

10:02.030 --> 10:02.980
Within those three days,

10:03.670 --> 10:04.530
she hopes...

10:06.080 --> 10:07.460
you'll finish whatever you intend.

10:11.960 --> 10:12.580
Sir,

10:13.150 --> 10:13.820
Master Su,

10:15.390 --> 10:16.580
these Tang Clan people

10:16.630 --> 10:17.770
are something else.

10:18.200 --> 10:19.490
Force first, courtesy after.

10:19.740 --> 10:20.220
This morning

10:20.510 --> 10:22.220
they chased our folks to kill,

10:22.550 --> 10:23.060
and by night

10:23.270 --> 10:25.130
they sent a handwritten letter to sue for peace.

10:25.390 --> 10:26.610
Have they found us here?

10:27.790 --> 10:28.340
Not quite.

10:28.960 --> 10:29.580
The Tang Clan knows

10:29.600 --> 10:31.030
Blood River has people

10:31.030 --> 10:32.210
in Jin City.

10:32.390 --> 10:33.610
But they don't know

10:33.840 --> 10:34.700
this teahouse

10:34.720 --> 10:36.130
is our stronghold.

10:36.360 --> 10:36.700
So,

10:37.080 --> 10:38.340
finding Blood River folk

10:38.440 --> 10:39.130
won't be easy,

10:39.480 --> 10:40.520
but getting a letter

10:40.600 --> 10:41.890
into Blood River hands

10:42.150 --> 10:42.980
is hardly difficult.

10:43.550 --> 10:44.490
What does the letter say?

10:50.270 --> 10:52.420
"From Chief Tang Fulu of Execution Hall:

10:52.670 --> 10:54.370
We invite Blood River's Patriarch

10:54.510 --> 10:55.420
Su Changhe

10:55.750 --> 10:57.530
and Su family head Su Muyu

10:58.080 --> 10:59.340
to meet at Dengjin Tower

10:59.790 --> 11:00.730
in Jin City

11:01.080 --> 11:02.460
for urgent discussions".

11:09.150 --> 11:10.940
Chief of Execution Hall?

11:12.200 --> 11:13.340
How interesting.

11:14.390 --> 11:16.040
Since when does an Execution Hall chief

11:16.040 --> 11:17.300
get to invite Blood River's Patriarch

11:17.300 --> 11:18.130
and family head?

11:20.720 --> 11:21.370
Looks like

11:22.120 --> 11:23.340
Tang Linghuang is either dead

11:23.390 --> 11:24.420
or trapped.

11:25.000 --> 11:26.180
Behind Tang Fulu,

11:26.360 --> 11:27.770
there must be someone

11:28.270 --> 11:28.980
of very high rank

11:29.000 --> 11:30.300
inside the Tang Clan.

11:31.320 --> 11:32.060
What do you think?

11:33.000 --> 11:34.300
Factions in the Tang Clan are tangled.

11:35.270 --> 11:36.770
Aside from Second Master Tang and Tang Lianyue,

11:37.320 --> 11:38.700
Blood River has no ties

11:38.720 --> 11:39.530
with the rest of them.

11:40.510 --> 11:41.530
With no feud between us,

11:42.320 --> 11:44.130
why'd they fight us to the death?

11:45.240 --> 11:46.180
Besides,

11:46.910 --> 11:48.100
Blood River's Patriarch

11:48.120 --> 11:49.700
is here in Jin City in person.

11:50.240 --> 11:51.420
They naturally feel

11:51.480 --> 11:52.420
this clash isn't necessary.

11:53.240 --> 11:54.650
That's not thanks to me.

11:55.030 --> 11:56.460
I'm guessing they don't know I'm here.

11:57.030 --> 11:58.770
This handwritten letter is a probe.

11:59.670 --> 12:01.010
After all, for years

12:01.080 --> 12:02.180
we've always shown up together.

12:03.120 --> 12:04.010
What made them decide

12:04.030 --> 12:05.700
not to be our enemy for now

12:06.550 --> 12:07.700
was the force you showed

12:07.840 --> 12:08.940
outside Jin City.

12:11.840 --> 12:12.580
Will you go

12:12.960 --> 12:13.700
to this banquet?

12:14.360 --> 12:15.060
Of course.

12:16.550 --> 12:18.100
We'll have to meet them anyway.

12:18.390 --> 12:19.010
Besides,

12:19.720 --> 12:21.340
we need to ensure Xuewei's safe.

12:21.950 --> 12:22.560
Muyu,

12:23.300 --> 12:25.190
in the Tang Clan's eyes,

12:25.190 --> 12:25.800
is Blood River

12:25.800 --> 12:27.250
nothing but profit-driven?

12:27.910 --> 12:29.530
If they choose to meet us,

12:30.670 --> 12:31.530
does that mean

12:32.200 --> 12:33.980
they think we can ally with?

12:36.200 --> 12:37.010
Then do you think

12:38.480 --> 12:40.420
Blood River is profit-driven?

12:41.750 --> 12:42.180
Sure.

12:42.910 --> 12:43.980
Shameless, even.

12:47.720 --> 12:48.650
But what counts as "profit"

12:48.790 --> 12:49.820
and how to seek it...

12:50.390 --> 12:51.530
everyone's standard

12:51.630 --> 12:52.180
is different.

12:54.870 --> 12:55.700
Right, Master Mu?

12:56.960 --> 12:57.580
Me?

12:58.150 --> 12:58.490
Sir,

12:58.630 --> 13:00.610
why bring me up all of a sudden?

13:01.270 --> 13:02.130
Don't worry.

13:02.720 --> 13:03.730
I don't suspect you.

13:05.270 --> 13:05.940
I've been

13:06.000 --> 13:07.250
watching you play mahjong lately.

13:07.480 --> 13:08.740
You could've won early,

13:08.740 --> 13:09.650
yet you didn't.

13:12.000 --> 13:13.730
Because there was bigger gain ahead.

13:16.030 --> 13:16.850
And...

13:17.840 --> 13:19.060
I've never feared waiting.

13:21.670 --> 13:22.180
Night Crow,

13:23.200 --> 13:24.420
don't keep making the same mistake.

13:24.840 --> 13:25.770
The dead are gone.

13:26.600 --> 13:27.460
That wasn't a mistake!

13:28.480 --> 13:29.650
How many times have I said it:

13:30.080 --> 13:31.650
I'm doing this to benefit the world!

13:33.150 --> 13:34.850
You still think I'm blindly clinging

13:34.870 --> 13:36.520
to reviving my dead husband?

13:37.120 --> 13:37.580
No.

13:38.390 --> 13:39.490
I've found something

13:39.870 --> 13:41.610
far more interesting.

13:43.000 --> 13:44.220
Something makes the living

13:44.600 --> 13:45.580
unharmed by blades

13:46.080 --> 13:47.650
and the dead rise as before.

13:49.150 --> 13:50.700
The drugged puppet art

13:51.120 --> 13:52.850
is far more interesting

13:53.030 --> 13:54.530
than those blasted blades and love!

13:54.960 --> 13:56.610
Your obsession has turned you insane!

13:57.720 --> 13:58.610
Senior,

13:59.510 --> 14:01.010
how about a deal?

14:02.720 --> 14:03.700
We join forces

14:03.870 --> 14:04.850
and turn this miss

14:05.390 --> 14:06.250
from a poisonous person

14:06.550 --> 14:07.980
back into a normal person.

14:09.790 --> 14:10.530
And...

14:12.480 --> 14:13.130
I'll tell you

14:13.150 --> 14:13.890
how I forge the living

14:13.910 --> 14:15.460
into drugged puppets.

14:17.510 --> 14:18.610
After that,

14:19.150 --> 14:21.130
you can study yourself

14:22.870 --> 14:24.770
how to undo my drugged puppet art.

14:26.030 --> 14:27.530
Given that you're brilliant,

14:27.790 --> 14:30.460
you'll crack it one day!

14:30.840 --> 14:32.100
As for me,

14:33.670 --> 14:35.610
I won't stand still.

14:43.080 --> 14:44.850
I do want to be normal.

14:46.440 --> 14:47.610
But if you use this

14:48.200 --> 14:49.420
to do filthy things,

14:51.030 --> 14:52.890
I won't mind using my last strength

14:53.960 --> 14:55.340
and every poison in me

14:57.200 --> 14:58.340
to die together with you.

15:00.750 --> 15:02.180
Hasn't Blood River

15:02.240 --> 15:03.340
done enough filthy deeds?

15:03.790 --> 15:05.010
In this world,

15:05.630 --> 15:07.100
why care so much

15:07.200 --> 15:07.890
about right and wrong?

15:09.240 --> 15:10.180
Besides,

15:10.870 --> 15:12.010
you don't get to decide.

15:14.720 --> 15:15.420
Senior,

15:16.600 --> 15:18.300
it's your call.

15:19.790 --> 15:20.650
If you obtain

15:20.670 --> 15:22.770
my improved drugged puppet art,

15:23.720 --> 15:24.700
perhaps

15:24.870 --> 15:26.580
you will stop me sooner.

15:27.150 --> 15:27.820
Don't you

15:28.440 --> 15:29.580
want that?

15:35.270 --> 15:36.530
You know as well as I do,

15:37.320 --> 15:39.220
given time,

15:40.240 --> 15:41.100
I can surely

15:41.150 --> 15:42.850
remove the poison from this girl.

15:44.120 --> 15:46.130
As for how...

15:49.840 --> 15:50.650
Senior,

15:51.750 --> 15:52.940
your help would be

15:53.750 --> 15:54.420
nothing more

15:54.440 --> 15:56.100
than saving her life.

16:01.340 --> 16:04.500
[Library]

16:16.440 --> 16:18.180
So you're General Dian.

16:18.630 --> 16:19.250
Never thought

16:19.550 --> 16:20.610
I'd meet you

16:20.750 --> 16:22.010
here of all places.

16:23.120 --> 16:23.650
Indeed.

16:23.650 --> 16:24.620
[Grand Master Tang of Tang Clan]

16:25.200 --> 16:27.530
A man who shouldn't be in Tianqi

16:28.150 --> 16:29.980
appearing in this city

16:31.000 --> 16:32.770
would strike anyone as odd.

16:33.480 --> 16:34.180
Grand Master Tang,

16:34.630 --> 16:35.340
the First Prince

16:35.550 --> 16:36.610
has been waiting.

16:37.600 --> 16:38.100
This way, please.

16:38.790 --> 16:39.220
Very well.

16:53.240 --> 16:55.650
This is the Tianqi Library.

16:56.630 --> 16:57.820
Open flames are forbidden.

16:58.390 --> 16:59.100
Your Highness,

16:59.910 --> 17:01.300
aren't you worried about a fire?

17:07.790 --> 17:09.620
I am the First Prince of Beili.

17:10.510 --> 17:11.620
Wherever I stand

17:12.680 --> 17:14.180
must be full of light,

17:14.880 --> 17:16.380
seen at a glance.

17:21.590 --> 17:22.900
Grand Master Tang.

17:28.590 --> 17:29.860
Greetings, Your Highness.

17:36.030 --> 17:38.180
I've long heard

17:38.640 --> 17:39.900
you're quite interesting.

17:42.510 --> 17:43.570
Meeting you today,

17:45.310 --> 17:46.530
it proves true.

17:51.070 --> 17:52.420
Your Highness

17:52.480 --> 17:54.900
dragged me here from the Tang Clan,

17:57.400 --> 17:58.140
surely not

17:58.550 --> 18:00.380
just for "interesting", right?

18:05.480 --> 18:06.220
I want

18:07.070 --> 18:08.860
an alliance with the Tang Clan.

18:13.160 --> 18:15.770
Many want alliance with us.

18:16.270 --> 18:17.180
But the Tang Clan

18:17.590 --> 18:19.570
already has a Xuanwu Guardian,

18:21.160 --> 18:22.980
a friend to the Prince of Langya.

18:24.590 --> 18:25.420
Prince of Langya

18:26.400 --> 18:28.290
never meddles in factional strife.

18:31.030 --> 18:32.090
The Prince of Langya?

18:32.920 --> 18:34.530
He's from the last generation.

18:36.030 --> 18:36.810
Back then,

18:37.270 --> 18:38.620
Lei Fortress and the Tang Clan

18:38.920 --> 18:40.420
made the right choice.

18:40.720 --> 18:42.980
They backed the Prince of Langya and my father,

18:43.310 --> 18:44.730
and won in the end.

18:46.000 --> 18:46.810
But now,

18:47.590 --> 18:49.180
it's a new era.

18:51.590 --> 18:52.490
You should

18:53.000 --> 18:54.380
make a new choice.

18:57.070 --> 18:57.940
A new choice?

18:59.240 --> 19:01.460
To beat Lei Fortress for good,

19:02.350 --> 19:03.220
or rather,

19:04.750 --> 19:05.900
make Lei Fortress

19:07.160 --> 19:09.090
vanish from the world.

19:14.110 --> 19:15.180
Dangling Lei Fortress's destruction

19:15.310 --> 19:16.570
to tempt the Tang Clan

19:17.640 --> 19:19.570
is quite the offer.

19:21.350 --> 19:22.050
But...

19:22.830 --> 19:23.770
why should I choose you,

19:23.830 --> 19:24.980
Your Highness?

19:28.000 --> 19:28.700
What do you mean?

19:29.880 --> 19:32.490
We're allied with Xueyue City.

19:33.720 --> 19:35.530
If we ally with you too,

19:36.790 --> 19:37.490
it'll surely clash

19:38.400 --> 19:39.810
with Xueyue City's plans

19:39.880 --> 19:40.900
and run against them.

19:42.270 --> 19:43.010
You know,

19:43.640 --> 19:44.900
crossing Baili Dongjun

19:45.480 --> 19:47.420
isn't easy.

19:51.920 --> 19:52.940
In short,

19:53.550 --> 19:55.090
you're talking terms.

19:57.200 --> 19:57.810
Guards!

19:58.070 --> 19:58.530
Wait.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.250
Your Highness,

20:02.110 --> 20:03.660
you haven't understood me.

20:05.440 --> 20:06.570
What I mean is:

20:08.350 --> 20:08.940
just no.

20:10.920 --> 20:11.730
Why not?

20:12.880 --> 20:13.810
Because today,

20:14.750 --> 20:16.180
the moment I saw you,

20:17.440 --> 20:18.860
I was disappointed.

20:21.270 --> 20:22.460
Disappointed?

20:27.750 --> 20:28.460
Disappointed.

20:30.110 --> 20:31.250
Years ago,

20:32.000 --> 20:34.010
when the Prince of Langya

20:34.240 --> 20:35.860
took Tang Lianyue from the Tang Clan,

20:37.270 --> 20:38.220
I was delighted.

20:39.200 --> 20:39.770
Though

20:40.830 --> 20:42.940
I don't like Xiao Ruofeng,

20:43.590 --> 20:45.660
he's truly exceptional.

20:46.960 --> 20:49.050
He won't take what he could claim,

20:49.480 --> 20:51.090
always yielding and yielding,

20:51.830 --> 20:52.490
even...

20:53.750 --> 20:54.980
the throne itself.

20:56.830 --> 20:59.490
When Lianyue left with the Prince of Langya,

21:00.310 --> 21:01.810
I truly thought

21:02.920 --> 21:05.140
they'd win renown across the land.

21:05.680 --> 21:06.770
And indeed,

21:08.160 --> 21:09.330
my judgment was right.

21:10.720 --> 21:11.330
However,

21:12.640 --> 21:13.620
today,

21:15.270 --> 21:16.460
seeing you,

21:17.880 --> 21:19.180
I don't see

21:20.550 --> 21:22.490
that promise in you.

21:25.160 --> 21:25.660
Xiang,

21:26.510 --> 21:26.810
let's go.

21:30.750 --> 21:31.620
Very well.

21:32.510 --> 21:33.380
Fine.

21:34.270 --> 21:34.940
Grand Master Tang,

21:34.960 --> 21:36.570
it's fine if you don't choose me.

21:37.310 --> 21:38.180
Because I'm not

21:38.200 --> 21:39.250
choosing you either.

21:40.070 --> 21:41.420
You're too old.

21:42.590 --> 21:43.730
When a man's too old,

21:44.240 --> 21:45.660
his eyes blur.

21:46.920 --> 21:47.860
When vision blurs,

21:48.110 --> 21:50.090
he makes the wrong choice.

21:53.640 --> 21:54.290
What do you mean?

21:57.440 --> 21:58.770
The Tang Clan today

22:00.200 --> 22:01.900
is about to change hands.

22:04.440 --> 22:05.980
And you, Grand Master Tang...

22:07.920 --> 22:08.730
you will

22:09.640 --> 22:10.730
die here.

22:18.960 --> 22:19.530
Grand Master!

22:23.070 --> 22:23.810
It's fine.

22:26.590 --> 22:29.050
Setting a trap for me, huh?

22:30.720 --> 22:32.810
I can't tell if you're foolish

22:34.200 --> 22:35.220
or just plain foolish!

22:48.960 --> 22:50.620
You think because this is Tianqi City,

22:51.880 --> 22:53.090
with so many people,

22:53.160 --> 22:54.290
you can kill me?

22:55.680 --> 22:56.380
Xiang,

22:57.790 --> 22:58.940
this idea of theirs

22:59.720 --> 23:00.570
is foolish, isn't it?

23:01.310 --> 23:02.810
Far too foolish.

23:03.510 --> 23:04.770
Since it's foolish,

23:05.720 --> 23:07.330
they'll pay the price.

23:17.000 --> 23:18.010
Even the Tang Clan

23:18.960 --> 23:19.860
can't afford the crime

23:19.860 --> 23:21.510
of killing a prince, can it?

23:22.350 --> 23:23.380
We can't afford it?

23:23.750 --> 23:25.490
Even if the juniors can't,

23:25.750 --> 23:27.090
Grand Master Tang will weigh it himself!

23:28.790 --> 23:29.860
Well said.

23:30.480 --> 23:31.290
Grand Master Tang,

23:31.830 --> 23:32.860
you're seriously underestimating

23:32.960 --> 23:33.730
Tianqi City.

23:34.640 --> 23:35.220
Outside,

23:35.880 --> 23:37.220
there's an entire army encircling us.

23:38.640 --> 23:39.220
Unless...

23:40.510 --> 23:41.380
you can kill

23:41.380 --> 23:42.620
everyone here tonight,

23:43.310 --> 23:43.980
otherwise,

23:44.880 --> 23:46.810
the whole Tianqi will hunt you down.

23:48.200 --> 23:48.770
Looks like...

23:50.400 --> 23:51.420
tonight, you're set

23:52.440 --> 23:53.940
on a fight to the bitter end.

23:54.510 --> 23:55.090
Grand Master,

23:55.400 --> 23:56.140
we shouldn't keep fighting.

23:56.440 --> 23:57.530
Find a chance and break out.

23:58.920 --> 23:59.810
Since they want to die,

24:01.790 --> 24:03.220
I'll let them die.

24:15.550 --> 24:16.530
Furious Sword Deity

24:17.350 --> 24:18.140
Yan Zhantian.

24:24.070 --> 24:25.010
Grand Master Tang,

24:25.720 --> 24:26.860
it's been a long time.

24:28.110 --> 24:28.980
You fiend,

24:29.640 --> 24:31.570
why are you in Tianqi City?

24:34.350 --> 24:35.380
Surely not

24:35.920 --> 24:37.460
for those useless fools!

24:44.880 --> 24:45.330
What,

24:45.920 --> 24:46.770
you want a fight?

24:47.680 --> 24:49.660
But I don't fight. I just kill.

24:50.830 --> 24:51.290
You all...

24:51.510 --> 24:52.570
are you ready?

24:53.790 --> 24:54.570
Furious Sword Deity,

24:55.030 --> 24:56.140
why have you come

24:56.510 --> 24:57.330
to Tianqi City?

24:58.160 --> 24:59.090
None of your business!

25:06.240 --> 25:06.980
Grand Master Tang,

25:08.200 --> 25:08.730
let's go.

25:10.790 --> 25:12.220
Are we on the same side?

25:14.270 --> 25:14.900
Perhaps...

25:15.510 --> 25:16.570
my disciple is, at least.

25:18.000 --> 25:20.250
Since when did you have a disciple?

25:22.030 --> 25:22.620
Why are there

25:22.830 --> 25:24.220
so many questions in this world?

25:24.880 --> 25:25.860
And must every question

25:26.720 --> 25:27.700
have an answer?

25:30.200 --> 25:30.530
Move.

25:50.980 --> 25:54.540
[Xiao Chong, Second Prince of Beili]

25:56.030 --> 25:56.570
They're here.

26:02.440 --> 26:03.660
Much obliged, Grandmaster.

26:05.200 --> 26:07.090
This is the Second Prince, Xiao Chong.

26:08.400 --> 26:10.380
Seems I'm easy to recognize.

26:10.720 --> 26:11.700
The Second Prince, Xiao Chong,

26:12.200 --> 26:13.250
was harmed as a child

26:13.440 --> 26:14.490
and lost his sight.

26:15.030 --> 26:16.180
That's hardly a secret

26:16.590 --> 26:17.620
in Tianqi City, is it?

26:18.110 --> 26:18.730
Correct.

26:20.110 --> 26:21.140
I am Xiao Chong.

26:21.400 --> 26:22.700
Greetings, Grand Master Tang.

26:25.240 --> 26:27.010
Greetings, Your Highness.

26:27.750 --> 26:29.770
On hearing you're here in Tianqi,

26:30.160 --> 26:30.860
we should've

26:31.030 --> 26:32.490
prepared more properly

26:32.960 --> 26:35.250
before inviting you to the residence.

26:35.590 --> 26:36.620
But tonight's events

26:37.000 --> 26:38.090
happened too suddenly,

26:38.350 --> 26:40.090
so I troubled the Grandmaster

26:40.350 --> 26:43.090
to arrange this brief meeting here.

26:44.310 --> 26:46.530
Please don't take offense.

26:50.310 --> 26:52.700
Quite an unusual prince.

26:54.480 --> 26:55.220
But...

26:55.510 --> 26:56.700
this humility,

26:56.920 --> 26:58.090
and this easy manner

26:59.030 --> 27:00.420
is a bit deliberate, isn't it?

27:01.070 --> 27:02.050
Besides me,

27:02.750 --> 27:04.140
Registrar Jin Yu

27:04.590 --> 27:05.700
is also his master.

27:06.680 --> 27:07.940
He learned my swordplay

27:08.680 --> 27:10.330
but Jin Yu's temper.

27:11.070 --> 27:12.140
So in swordplay,

27:13.590 --> 27:15.220
he hasn't improved at all.

27:16.310 --> 27:17.490
That's because I lack talent

27:17.680 --> 27:18.420
in the sword.

27:19.110 --> 27:20.730
Still, you are remarkable.

27:21.680 --> 27:23.660
You and the Prince of Langya

27:23.790 --> 27:24.770
are nothing alike.

27:25.200 --> 27:25.770
However,

27:26.790 --> 27:27.730
I can see in you

27:27.830 --> 27:29.530
something intriguing.

27:33.000 --> 27:34.460
[Dengjin Tower]
This way, please.

27:34.750 --> 27:35.570
I've been to this restaurant often.

27:35.720 --> 27:36.220
This way, please.

27:37.350 --> 27:39.180
The ways of the world are curious.

27:40.200 --> 27:41.290
Days ago, Tang disciples

27:41.350 --> 27:42.460
were out for my blood.

27:43.720 --> 27:45.460
Today, they host me here.

27:47.680 --> 27:48.810
So what?

27:50.030 --> 27:52.180
Back when the Demonic Sect marched east,

27:53.070 --> 27:54.460
no one imagined

27:54.480 --> 27:56.050
Blood River would aid the defense.

27:57.070 --> 27:58.810
Sometimes, enemies and friends

27:59.200 --> 28:00.620
are a single thought apart.

28:03.590 --> 28:05.090
Can those bound by profit

28:05.720 --> 28:07.160
still be called friends?

28:08.440 --> 28:09.010
I'm Tang Lingzun

28:09.270 --> 28:10.050
of the Tang Clan.

28:10.720 --> 28:11.620
You must be

28:11.960 --> 28:13.220
the Patriarch.

28:24.030 --> 28:25.140
I only glimpsed Master Su

28:25.680 --> 28:27.050
in passing last time.

28:27.880 --> 28:28.530
Back then,

28:29.030 --> 28:29.810
you were the Umbrella Ghost

28:29.830 --> 28:31.140
sent to kill Liu Yilong.

28:32.640 --> 28:33.700
Years later,

28:34.270 --> 28:35.490
you're still this handsome.

28:37.200 --> 28:38.050
Madam,

28:38.640 --> 28:39.420
are you married?

28:39.750 --> 28:40.290
No.

28:42.920 --> 28:43.490
Understood.

28:45.000 --> 28:46.290
Understood what, Sir?

28:47.400 --> 28:47.900
Nothing.

28:49.200 --> 28:50.990
How did you know

28:51.030 --> 28:52.250
I'm in Jin City too?

28:53.590 --> 28:54.620
Everyone knows

28:55.310 --> 28:57.100
Blood River's Patriarch

28:57.110 --> 28:58.290
and the Su family head

28:58.830 --> 29:00.330
are inseparable,

29:00.510 --> 29:01.490
always together.

29:01.880 --> 29:03.490
He wouldn't come alone.

29:09.070 --> 29:09.860
Alone?

29:11.830 --> 29:12.730
Our Mu family head

29:12.790 --> 29:13.490
came as well,

29:15.070 --> 29:16.730
nearly died at your hands,

29:17.640 --> 29:18.660
still not fully recovered.

29:19.920 --> 29:20.530
Otherwise,

29:21.030 --> 29:23.460
he'd be here today for an answer.

29:26.000 --> 29:27.180
Just a misunderstanding.

29:29.030 --> 29:29.900
Now,

29:30.270 --> 29:31.380
let's talk business.

29:31.680 --> 29:32.420
Business?

29:33.590 --> 29:35.460
Madam, you do get straight to the point.

29:38.030 --> 29:39.050
Where is Tang Linghuang?

29:40.240 --> 29:41.090
Master Su,

29:41.480 --> 29:43.620
you're just as direct as I am.

29:43.920 --> 29:44.730
Because this is an answer

29:44.750 --> 29:45.980
we must have.

29:47.790 --> 29:49.180
I really can't tell you

29:49.680 --> 29:50.940
where Tang Linghuang is.

29:51.590 --> 29:53.350
But I can tell you this:

29:54.160 --> 29:55.290
he won't appear again.

29:56.200 --> 29:58.050
In the Tang Clan, only I am qualified

29:58.750 --> 30:00.330
to negotiate with you.

30:00.960 --> 30:01.570
You?

30:02.070 --> 30:02.810
Of course.

30:06.110 --> 30:06.700
Fine.

30:07.590 --> 30:08.220
As for me,

30:08.750 --> 30:10.010
I'll talk to anyone

30:10.920 --> 30:12.420
so long as we get

30:12.440 --> 30:13.290
what we want.

30:14.160 --> 30:15.490
What can you offer us, Madam?

30:20.350 --> 30:20.940
Muyu,

30:21.270 --> 30:21.980
since it's a negotiation,

30:22.350 --> 30:23.860
let's show Blood River's good faith.

30:24.350 --> 30:25.460
Go settle the bill

30:25.640 --> 30:26.490
for this banquet.

30:27.160 --> 30:27.730
Today,

30:28.200 --> 30:29.810
Blood River treats the Madam.

30:32.550 --> 30:33.010
All right.

30:43.790 --> 30:45.250
The Su family head himself

30:46.160 --> 30:47.770
goes to pay the bill?

30:48.350 --> 30:49.620
Only a handful of us

30:49.750 --> 30:50.420
came to Jin City.

30:51.240 --> 30:52.530
We're here to make an alliance,

30:53.440 --> 30:54.810
not pick a fight.

30:57.030 --> 30:58.290
Why isn't the Spider Woman here?

30:59.510 --> 31:00.460
Yumo isn't the family head.

31:01.030 --> 31:02.460
She came for other business.

31:03.310 --> 31:04.050
Don't mind it.

31:07.160 --> 31:08.050
Other business?

31:09.550 --> 31:10.830
Blood River does seem

31:10.830 --> 31:11.810
quite interested in Jin City.

31:13.880 --> 31:15.770
We're interested in plenty.

31:17.590 --> 31:18.330
For instance,

31:20.270 --> 31:21.490
our family.

31:40.440 --> 31:41.290
By "family",

31:42.000 --> 31:42.700
do you mean her?

31:47.750 --> 31:49.490
I mean her safe and sound.

31:50.510 --> 31:51.940
What counts as "safe and sound"?

31:52.510 --> 31:53.250
Are you not afraid to die?

31:57.830 --> 31:58.940
Blood River's "Poisonous Blossom"

31:59.640 --> 32:00.530
used to kill with a single touch.

32:01.310 --> 32:02.140
But now,

32:02.440 --> 32:04.250
she's just an ordinary lady.

32:05.550 --> 32:06.620
If such a person

32:07.270 --> 32:08.570
still counts

32:08.640 --> 32:10.770
as your family, Sir?

32:15.510 --> 32:17.420
You stripped the poison from Xuewei?

32:18.200 --> 32:19.010
Is that

32:19.680 --> 32:21.490
still "safe and sound"?

32:27.000 --> 32:27.940
Whatever you did,

32:28.640 --> 32:30.010
now that she's

32:30.030 --> 32:30.770
in front of me,

32:31.350 --> 32:32.940
you can't lay a hand on her again.

32:38.240 --> 32:39.220
The Blood River Patriarch

32:39.750 --> 32:41.490
is so loyal and true?

32:42.590 --> 32:44.700
That doesn't match my intel.

32:46.830 --> 32:48.220
And what does your intel say?

32:49.240 --> 32:49.900
Anything in there

32:50.270 --> 32:51.730
about my looks?

32:52.720 --> 32:53.380
Like...

32:53.830 --> 32:55.660
handsome with a roguish edge,

32:56.400 --> 32:57.010
and a touch

32:57.310 --> 32:58.420
of uncommon charm?

32:59.160 --> 33:00.330
The Blood River Patriarch,

33:00.550 --> 33:01.380
Su Changhe,

33:02.000 --> 33:03.140
codename Undertaker,

33:03.880 --> 33:05.180
is a profit-driven man

33:05.750 --> 33:07.820
with sentiment, no ethics,

33:08.160 --> 33:10.380
and a cruel hand.

33:11.030 --> 33:11.770
Not a bad summary.

33:12.550 --> 33:13.810
Yet it seems

33:14.720 --> 33:16.700
you do know sentiment and ethics.

33:18.880 --> 33:20.320
Everyone in Blood River

33:20.320 --> 33:21.350
wears a mask.

33:21.510 --> 33:22.980
Under the mask is the true self.

33:23.790 --> 33:25.010
Believe it or not,

33:25.590 --> 33:26.490
I'm actually

33:26.510 --> 33:28.290
a loyal, stand-up man.

33:31.640 --> 33:32.490
Sir,

33:32.510 --> 33:34.050
you are interesting.

33:35.510 --> 33:36.530
Pity, though...

33:37.310 --> 33:38.180
Pity what?

33:38.880 --> 33:40.530
You're not as good-looking as Master Su.

33:41.000 --> 33:41.990
That tongue's pure poison!

33:42.350 --> 33:43.460
Naturally.

33:43.750 --> 33:45.240
I'm the Tang Clan's Inner Hall Chief,

33:45.240 --> 33:46.660
the most poisonous one of all.

33:47.680 --> 33:48.730
Since you've seen

33:49.400 --> 33:50.700
your "family",

33:51.920 --> 33:53.050
as for our business...

34:04.720 --> 34:05.460
Sir...

34:18.920 --> 34:19.460
I...

34:19.760 --> 34:20.490
Rest up for now.

34:21.230 --> 34:21.980
I'll speak for you.

34:32.070 --> 34:32.690
We can talk.

34:33.670 --> 34:34.260
Go on.

34:37.360 --> 34:39.010
Master Su isn't back yet.

34:39.760 --> 34:40.420
Shouldn't we

34:41.360 --> 34:42.940
discuss this with him too?

34:45.550 --> 34:46.170
With me here,

34:46.400 --> 34:47.690
he needn't say much.

34:48.400 --> 34:49.090
We've always thought

34:49.110 --> 34:49.940
the same way,

34:50.550 --> 34:51.570
always have.

34:55.840 --> 34:56.420
Something's off.

34:56.920 --> 34:57.650
What's off?

34:59.480 --> 35:00.780
I hear Master Su

35:00.920 --> 35:02.610
and Mu Xuewei go way back.

35:03.190 --> 35:04.940
The "Poisonous Blossom" is right here,

35:05.360 --> 35:06.980
yet he left first.

35:08.070 --> 35:10.130
Everything about this seems off.

35:11.000 --> 35:12.090
He probably figured

35:12.360 --> 35:13.570
the food here wasn't to his taste,

35:13.920 --> 35:14.980
so he went to find lighter dishes.

35:15.630 --> 35:17.010
In Jin City,

35:17.280 --> 35:18.260
where can you find light dishes?

35:19.000 --> 35:19.820
Perhaps

35:20.710 --> 35:21.610
the Tang Clan?

35:23.220 --> 35:26.700
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

35:26.740 --> 35:30.620
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

35:32.460 --> 35:35.940
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

35:35.980 --> 35:39.820
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

35:41.820 --> 35:45.100
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

35:45.220 --> 35:47.300
♪Still I can't let go♪

35:47.460 --> 35:50.900
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

35:51.380 --> 35:53.580
♪My heart no longer my own♪

35:53.700 --> 35:58.700
♪No one can escape from love♪

36:15.300 --> 36:19.020
♪How many hidden feelings♪

36:19.140 --> 36:23.220
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

36:24.460 --> 36:28.340
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

36:28.460 --> 36:32.700
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

36:33.820 --> 36:36.700
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

36:36.780 --> 36:41.020
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

36:43.300 --> 36:47.300
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

36:47.340 --> 36:50.780
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

36:52.300 --> 36:55.740
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

36:55.820 --> 36:59.620
